                 * 7.0.33    5.0.12-dev  ubuntu18.04.1     15in. 2017 Apple® MacBook® Pro on    Intel® Core i7           172.16.225.128
                 *                                         MacOS Mojave 10.14.6 w/Ubuntu® VM    2.9 GHz,
