         *       sys_getloadavg() calls for 'history',
         *       'usage', an 'delta' $output_type
         *       input datum.
         *       5 :: Monday, February 9, 2026 @ 0350 hrs.
         *
         * # C # R # N # R # S # T # N # :: # L # I # G # H # T
         * Edit: With beer in hand, begin re-design
         *       of memory_performance() behavior
         *       in the full light of the divine
